    "enUS": {
      "description": "It is good to see you again, {name}. I have been reading the notes you brought to us, and speaking with Onku, our eldest seer, about the matter.\r\n\r\nHe has recently been granted a vision that may lead us to the draenethyst sphere. We would like to share the revelations of that vision with you, if you'd join us for a moment?",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Watch Onku's vision with Magtoor",
          "type": "event"
